    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在满足 |KG(jω)|=1 的截止频率处，闭环幅值 |T(jω)| 很大程度上取决于相角裕度 (PM)。当 PM 为 90° 时，|T(jω_c)|=0.707；而当 PM 为 45° 时，|T(jω_c)|=1.31。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "At the crossover frequency where |KG(jω)|=1, the closed-loop magnitude |T(jω)| depends heavily on the phase margin (PM). A PM of 90° gives |T(jω_c)|=0.707, while a PM of 45° gives |T(jω_c)|=1.31.",
